or:rgb(92,11,214);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(111,19,209);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS BRIEF</span></p></section></section></section></section><section id=\"yaodian\" style=\"margin:20px 10px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">01</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯文档发布「人机双写」功能并原生接入WorkBuddy构建AI原生编辑器</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">02</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美国众议院发布269页AI立法草案，拟对前沿AI模型实施半年一审</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">03</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布支持特朗普AI行政令，承诺模型发布前接受政府安全评估</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare监测显示机器人流量占比超57%，未来互联网或全面转向付费抓取</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯文档发布「人机双写」功能并原生接入WorkBuddy构建AI原生编辑器</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/253447d8854f4e6178ea27ff659528a2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月5日，腾讯文档在2026腾讯云AI产业应用大会上发布行业首创的「人机双写」能力，标志其正式进化为AI原生内容平台。该功能原生接入WorkBuddy统一Agent内核，AI以同事身份进入编辑器，与用户享有同等操作权和上下文感知，支持实时同屏协作，涵盖文字填充、数据清洗、图表生成及PPT美化等任务，并能自动解决双重编辑冲突，实现操作逐条可回溯。目前，腾讯文档企业版已全品类AI化，作为「效率智能体套件」核心组件内嵌至WorkBuddy工作台，支持读取存量资产。技术层面，腾讯文档依托腾讯混元大模型算力，通过Skill（MCP协议）与OpenAPI双通道开放百余项接口，实现模型与产品Co-Design。此次升级推动行业从对话式AI迈向执行式AI，重塑了原生编辑范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国众议院发布269页AI立法草案，拟对前沿AI模型实施半年一审</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国众议院两党议员近日公布《伟大美国人工智能法案（Great American Artificial Intelligence Act of 2026）》讨论稿。该草案针对上一年收入超5亿美元且训练过大型前沿模型的企业，要求其每半年聘请独立机构进行安全审计，违规者面临每日最高100万美元罚款。法案重点防范AI在武器制造、网络攻击及造成重大伤亡等方面的灾难性风险。草案最具争议的条款是“州法优先权”，规定在生效后三年内，州和地方政府不得制定专门监管AI模型开发的法律，旨在统一联邦监管标准。此外，草案还包含员工举报保护、提高AI金融诈骗量刑标准，以及研究AI对就业影响等内容。目前该草案处于征求反馈阶段，行业组织NetChoice对强制审计可能泄露商业秘密表示担忧。该法案能否在8月国会休会前获得通过，仍存在较大不确定性</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布支持特朗普AI行政令，承诺模型发布前接受政府安全评估</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式表态支持特朗普签署的人工智能模型发布前审查行政命令，并确认将参与相关评估流程。该行政命令要求联邦政府在AI模型正式发布前30天获得访问权限，企业需配合基准测试，以评估模型在网络能力等方面的先进程度，并据此界定“受监管的前沿模型”。OpenAI负责各国事务的负责人乔治·奥斯本表示，公司不会被动等待监管要求，而是主动寻求与各国政府合作。奥斯本强调，OpenAI主张建立强有力且具备高度灵活性的监管机构，以适应AI技术的快速演进。此举标志着OpenAI在面对美国联邦政府强化审查压力时，采取了积极配合的合作姿态，旨在平衡前沿AI创新与国家安全监管需求，为行业设定最低监管门槛提供参考。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare监测显示机器人流量占比超57%，未来互联网或全面转向付费抓取</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e36765e1131c7c20912db2cc8090cc2a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cloudflare监测数据显示，互联网机器人自动流量已正式超越人类流量，占比达57.4%，这一拐点较此前预测的2027年提前到来。受AI智能体与爬虫访问激增驱动，网络流量格局发生根本性逆转。Cloudflare CEO马修·普林斯指出，互联网生态正走向“付费抓取”时代，网站所有者需转变对抗思维，将自动化访问转化为商业变现机遇。为应对这一趋势，Cloudflare正开发全新的协议与底层基础设施，以支撑未来高频结算与流量控制需求。此前，Cloudflare曾推出允许网站拦截并对AI爬虫收费的服务平台，但受限于生态配套未获广泛应用。随着谷歌AI概述等功能普及，用户获取信息方式正从传统网页浏览向AI总结转变，倒逼网络基础设施加速升级以适应新的AI交互模式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于6月4日发布文章《当AI构建自身》，披露AI在代码编写与系统优化方面的惊人进展，并呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发以防范失控风险。数据显示，截至2026年5月，Anthropic代码库中超80%代码由Claude自主编写，工程师代码交付量较2024年同期增长8倍。在模型训练优化测试中，Claude的加速能力已从3倍提升至52倍，且AI独立完成任务的时长缩短至每4个月翻倍。Anthropic警告，AI正逼近“递归自我改进”阶段，即在无人类介入下自主升级，若当前模型存在微小“不对齐”行为，可能在迭代中被复利放大导致失控。公司建议建立全球协调机制，在必要时主动放慢研发，为AI对齐研究留出调适时间。尽管Anthropic已启动IPO筹备，年化收入突破470亿美元，但此次公开表态折射出前沿科技在商业狂飙与技术</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
